# Deck the Halls: Welsh air "Nos Galan" with Thomas Oliphant's English words (1862).
{title: Deck the Halls}
{composer: Traditional (Wales)}
{lyricist: Thomas Oliphant}
{key: G}
{tempo: 116}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - D U - U D U}

